 "incoherences_tous_controles": "<div class=\"tab-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"incoherences\">Brebis à régulariser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"reproduction\">Bilan de reproduction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"economique\">Bilan économique</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lactation\">Bilan de lactation</button></div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);margin:2px 2px 14px;\">Ce qui reste à vérifier ou à corriger avant la clôture de la campagne en cours (2027).</div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-amber\">À régulariser</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 brebis (50%)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px;\">Ni mise bas, ni vide définitive enregistrée cette campagne — une échographie seule ne suffit pas à sortir une brebis de cette liste.</div>\n        <div>\n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299930001\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°30001</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299930002\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°30002</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299960002\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°60002</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">0 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      </div><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-green\">Ont mis bas</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);\">3 brebis (50%)</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299950001\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°50001</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">1 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299950002\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°50002</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">1 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"bilan-eid-link\" data-id=\"f250016299960001\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">n°60001</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">0 an(s)</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      </div>\n  ",
 "lactation": "<div class=\"tab-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"incoherences\">Brebis à régulariser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"reproduction\">Bilan de reproduction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"economique\">Bilan économique</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"lactation\">Bilan de lactation</button></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin:2px 2px 10px;\"><span class=\"info-bulle-btn\" data-info-id=\"ib0\" title=\"Mode d'emploi\" style=\"cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;margin-left:6px;\">❔</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n      <label>Campagne consultée</label>\n      <select id=\"bilan-lactation-campagne-select\">\n        <option value=\"2026\" selected=\"\">Campagne 2027</option><option value=\"2025\">Campagne 2026</option><option value=\"2024\">Campagne 2025</option><option value=\"2023\">Campagne 2024</option><option value=\"2022\">Campagne 2023</option><option value=\"2021\">Campagne 2022</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n      <label>Litrage total produit sur la campagne (L)</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.1\" id=\"bilan-lactation-litrage-total\" placeholder=\"ex: 78450\" value=\"4000\">\n      \n      <label style=\"display:block;margin-top:14px;\">Brebis passées à la traite</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" step=\"1\" id=\"bilan-lactation-brebis-traite\" placeholder=\"ex: 415\" value=\"3\">\n      \n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:8px;\">Litrage total pré-rempli automatiquement depuis le tank de Production laitière (modifiable si la saisie tank est incomplète). Brebis passées à la traite = toutes celles ayant eu au moins un contrôle laitier cette campagne, calculé automatiquement (modifiable au besoin).</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:10px;\">Campagne 2026 (N-1) : — · 1 brebis</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid2\">\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Litrage / brebis traite</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--blue-fg);\">1333,3 L</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px;\">N-1 : <b>—</b></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Litrage / brebis présente</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--blue-fg);\">666,7 L</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px;\">N-1 : <b>—</b></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin:10px 0;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Ratio brebis traites / brebis ayant mis bas</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;\">100,0 %</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px;\">3 traites ÷ 3 mises bas (Bilan de reproduction troupeau) — un ratio supérieur à 100 % est possible (des brebis restées vides ou achetées en lactation peuvent aussi être traites).</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:6px;\">N-1 : <b>—</b></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n      <label>Brebis présentes (moyenne de présence sur la campagne)</label>\n      <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.1\" id=\"bilan-lactation-brebis-presentes\" placeholder=\"ex: 380\" value=\"6\">\n      \n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:8px;\">Calculé automatiquement : moyenne mensuelle de l'effectif sur les 12 mois de la campagne (octobre à septembre), à partir de l'effectif de début de campagne, ajustée chaque mois selon les sorties ET les entrées survenues ce mois-là. Modifiable si tu as une connaissance terrain plus fine.</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:6px;\">N-1 : <b>6,0</b></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"btn-export-bilan-lactation-pdf\" style=\"flex:1;\">Export PDF</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"btn-export-bilan-lactation-xlsx\" style=\"flex:1;\">Export Excel</button>\n    </div>\n  ",
 "economique": "<div class=\"tab-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"incoherences\">Brebis à régulariser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"reproduction\">Bilan de reproduction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"economique\">Bilan économique</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-tab=\"lactation\">Bilan de lactation</button></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin:2px 2px 10px;\"><span class=\"info-bulle-btn\" data-info-id=\"ib1\" title=\"Mode d'emploi\" style=\"cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;margin-left:6px;\">❔</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n      <label>Campagne consultée</label>\n      <select id=\"bilan-eco-campagne-select\">\n        <option value=\"2026\" selected=\"\">Campagne 2027</option><option value=\"2025\">Campagne 2026</option><option value=\"2024\">Campagne 2025</option><option value=\"2023\">Campagne 2024</option><option value=\"2022\">Campagne 2023</option><option value=\"2021\">Campagne 2022</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"bilan-eco-prix-coef-card\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">💶 Prix du lait</div>\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"btn-prix-coef\" style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-muted);background:none;border:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;\">Coefficient MSU : <span id=\"prix-coef-value\">12,1538</span> ✎</button>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"qualite-prix-coef-edit\" class=\"hidden\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n        <div id=\"prix-coef-heritage\" style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px;\"></div>\n        <label style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">Prix référence (€/1000L) — optionnel</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.01\" id=\"prix-ref-input\" placeholder=\"ex. 1580\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">\n        <label style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">MSU référence (g/L) — optionnel</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.01\" id=\"msu-ref-input\" placeholder=\"ex. 130\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">\n        <label style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">Coefficient MSU (€/1000L par point) — calculé si les 2 champs ci-dessus sont remplis, sinon à saisir directement</label>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;\">\n          <input type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" id=\"prix-coef-input\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"btn-prix-coef-save\" style=\"width:auto;padding:10px 16px;margin:0;\">OK</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"chip-list\" id=\"bilan-eco-mois\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:4px;\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2026-10\">Oct 26</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2026-11\">Nov 26</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2026-12\">Déc 26</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2027-01\">Jan 27</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2027-02\">Fév 27</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2027-03\">Mar 27</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2027-04\">Avr 27</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2027-05\">Mai 27</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2027-06\">Jun 27</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2027-07\">Jul 27</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2027-08\">Aoû 27</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip chip-empty\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\" data-mois=\"2027-09\">Sep 27</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"bilan-eco-prix-mois-card\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;\">💶 Détail du mois</div>\n      <div id=\"bilan-eco-prix-mois-body\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Prix hors qualité <span style=\"font-size:11px;\">(MSU × 12,1538)</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px;\">—</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);\">\n    <div><div style=\"font-size:13.5px;\">Cellules<span class=\"badge badge-muted\" style=\"margin-left:6px;\">—</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px;\">pas de résultat ce mois</div></div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;\">0,00 €</div>\n  </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);\">\n    <div><div style=\"font-size:13.5px;\">Coliformes<span class=\"badge badge-muted\" style=\"margin-left:6px;\">—</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px;\">pas de résultat ce mois</div></div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;\">0,00 €</div>\n  </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);\">\n    <div><div style=\"font-size:13.5px;\">Flore totale<span class=\"badge badge-muted\" style=\"margin-left:6px;\">—</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px;\">pas de résultat ce mois</div></div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;\">0,00 €</div>\n  </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);\">\n    <div><div style=\"font-size:13.5px;\">Butyriques<span class=\"badge badge-muted\" style=\"margin-left:6px;\">—</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px;\">pas de résultat ce mois</div></div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;\">0,00 €</div>\n  </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);\">\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:13.5px;\">Bonus Super A<span class=\"badge badge-coral\" style=\"margin-left:6px;\">Non obtenu</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px;\">Grade non-A : Cellules, Coliformes, Flore totale, Butyriques</div></div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;\">0,00 €</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"note-warn\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:0;\">Statut Super A calculé sur les critères suivis par Ovilog (4 grades + Listéria/Salmonelles). La grille laiterie exige aussi l'absence d'antibiotiques, de virage résazurine et de déclassement pour conditions d'hygiène insuffisantes — à vérifier hors Ovilog avant application.</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;border-top:2px solid var(--border);margin-top:10px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;\">Prix avec qualité</div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;\">—</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px;\">\n      <div>Volume livré ce mois (tank)</div><div>0 L</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:6px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px;\">Total du mois</div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:var(--primary);\">—</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stat-grid\">\n      <div class=\"stat-card sc-green\" id=\"eco-stat-production\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card-label\">Lait total produit sur la campagne</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-value\">4000 L</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-sub\">Tank, toute la campagne</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card sc-blue\" id=\"eco-stat-prix-hors\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card-label\">Prix moy. hors qualité</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-value\">—</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-sub\">/1000L, pondéré volume</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card sc-blue\" id=\"eco-stat-prix-avec\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card-label\">Prix moy. avec qualité</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-value\">—</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-sub\">/1000L, pondéré volume</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card sc-blue\" id=\"eco-stat-montant-hors\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card-label\">Montant total hors qualité</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-value\">—</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-sub\">Au prix MSU seul</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-grid\">\n      <div class=\"stat-card sc-blue\" id=\"eco-stat-montant-avec\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card-label\">Montant total avec qualité</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-value\">—</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-sub\">Grades + Super A + pénalités bactério</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card sc-green\" id=\"eco-stat-super-a\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card-label\">Montant total Super A</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-value\">0,00 €</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-sub\">Part positive du gain</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card sc-coral\" id=\"eco-stat-penalites\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card-label\">Montant total pénalités</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-value\">0,00 €</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-card-sub\">Part négative du gain</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-card sc-green\" id=\"eco-stat-gain\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <div class=\"stat-card-label\">Gain lié à la qualité (bactério + Super A + pénalités)</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card-value\">—</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card-sub\">= montant avec qualité − montant hors qualité</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin:4px 2px 10px;\">Pour le tank, les prélèvements bruts ou le détail mensuel TB/TP/cellules/MSU, direction Production laitière.</div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"btn-export-rapport-campagne-pdf\">🖨️ Rapport de campagne (PDF)</button>\n  ",
